        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-07T00:45:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After 1 second of base_power_on_attempts reaching 3, it will be reset. (actually anytime there\u0027s a base power fault, the counter will be reset within 1 second of the last attempt). This seems okay to me?",
